   ],
   "x": "The 1992 honorary Oscar went to Satyajit Ray, not Bhanu Athaiya. Bhanu Athaiya was the first Indian Oscar winner, for Best Costume Design for Gandhi (1982 film; award given at the 1983 ceremony). Mother India (1958) was the first Indian film nominated."
  },
